    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry, it's nothing to worry about, really-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301268585152595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Just been a little lost in my head, that's all.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301268585152596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (A bipolar moodswing, maybe?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, since we've finished dinner, how about we end our day off with
