    dialog: The four ordered and shared an apple pie among themselves.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247040
    - rid: 6136301314188247041
    - rid: 6136301314188247042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah... that was some delectable pie.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure he overdid the cinnamon, but yeah, it was pretty good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247044
    - rid: 6136301314188247045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, wait a minute...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247046
    - rid: 6136301314188247047
    - rid: 6136301314188247049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you guys think we should've saved Monika a slice?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For as cold as Skyrim can get, we don't exactly have easy refridgeration;
      where even would we keep that slice?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247051
    - rid: 6136301314188247052
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Technically, we don't even know if Monika is still alive-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247053
    - rid: 6136301314188247054
    - rid: 6136301314188247055
    - rid: 6136301314188247056
    - rid: 6136301314188247074
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, no. Quit making Sayori sad.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247057
    - rid: 6136301314188247058
    - rid: 6136301314188247059
    - rid: 6136301314188247060
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah, but still, we don't know when she's getting back from her
      Dark Brotherhood business.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247062
    - rid: 6136301314188247063
    - rid: 6136301314188247064
    - rid: 6136301314188247065
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: As in the assassin's guild- that Dark Brotherhood?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247066
    - rid: 6136301314188247067
    - rid: 6136301314188247068
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I know Monika's supposed to be a guard captain, but wouldn't it be a
      bit fool-hardy to go directly after a group of renowned assassins?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247069
    - rid: 6136301314188247075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'It kind of is, but not completely impossible of a task:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247070
    - rid: 6136301314188247071
    - rid: 6136301314188247072
    - rid: 6136301314188247073
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As of year 201 of the Fourth era, the current year, the Dark Brotherhood
      is at a major low point.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The only known sanctuary with active members left in the organization
      is in Falkreath, numbering no more than 10 people in total-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> there's been no listener for years, meaning that no one can
      talk to the Night Mother, who's the person who delivers contracts.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, basically, the only spiritual element separating the Brotherhood
      from a band of killers doesn't want anything to do with them right now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247076
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They'll still put up a fight, obviously, but if you wanted them gone,
      now's the time to do something.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247077
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I see, do you think that-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247078
    - rid: 6136301314188247079
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki lets out a long yawn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247080
    - rid: 6136301314188247083
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It <i>is</i> pretty late, isn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247084
    - rid: 6136301314188247085
    - rid: 6136301314188247086
    - rid: 6136301314188247087
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As nice as its been eating with y'all, I'm gonna hit the hay.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247088
    - rid: 6136301314188247089
    - rid: 6136301314188247090
    - rid: 6136301314188247091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: See you tomorrow, assuming you'll all still be in town.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247092
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, Meeko.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247093
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You're not going with him, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247143
    - rid: 6136301314188247144
    - rid: 6136301314188247145
    - rid: 6136301314188247146
    - rid: 6136301314188247147
    - rid: 6136301331671416839
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah... but before I go, could I ask you two a question?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247148
    - rid: 6136301314188247149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, shoot. What's up?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301314188247150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do... do you think he'll get better with time?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136301331671416832
    - rid: 6136301331671416834
    - rid: 6136301331671416835
    - rid: 6136301331671416840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
